                "• Suppose <code>f2.txt</code> contains <code>zebra lion</code>. Running <code>sort f1.txt &gt;&gt; f2.txt</code> sorts <code>f1.txt</code> (keeping duplicates because <code>uniq</code> was not used: <code>apple banana banana orange</code>) and <b>appends</b> it after <code>zebra lion</code>, so <code>f2.txt</code> becomes: <b><code>zebra lion apple banana banana orange</code></b>."
